# Superpowers Skill Workflow

Before any task, check whether a Superpowers skill applies.

- Use process skills first: `brainstorming`, `systematic-debugging`, `writing-plans`.
- Use implementation skills second: `executing-plans`, `subagent-driven-development`.
- Use `requesting-code-review` before merge or after major features.
- Prefer the role-specific skill order from `.cursor/rules/agent-roles.mdc` when a
  Harness role is active.
